If I add a Custom Domain later (e.g. monarchihq.com):
I must update the Fly secret:

bash
fly secrets set APP_URL="https://monarchihq.com"
IMPORTANT

One quick reminder for OAuth logins: In your Google Cloud Console and Azure Portal (Microsoft Entra): Make sure to add https://monarchihq.fly.dev/auth/google/callback and https://monarchihq.fly.dev/auth/microsoft/callback to your Authorized redirect URIs list so Google and Microsoft logins work in production.

